acmers (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add External Account Binding (EAB) for ACME account registration.
  * Add CA presets for ZeroSSL, Google Trust Services, SSL.com (ECC/RSA),
    Buypass, and Sectigo, plus --ca, --eab-kid, --eab-hmac-key, and
    ACME_EAB_KID / ACME_EAB_HMAC_KEY.
  * Persist the selected CA in renewal.json and show it in 'acmers show'.
  * Document EAB, CA presets, and the Buypass discontinuation.
  * Update docs and openspec for 0.4.0.

 -- José Carretero <josacar@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:48:31 +0200

acmers (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add certbot-compatible certificate layout, SAN-preserving renewal,
    install paths, deployment hooks, DNS propagation checks, and ARI.
  * Add per-server accounts, staging isolation, certificate management
    commands, preferred chains, and renewal locking.
  * Add certbot-style twice-daily systemd timer, writable service unit,
    /etc/acmers/env credentials, --env-file, and cron fallback.
  * Update provider helpers and test coverage.

 -- José Carretero <josacar@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:53:18 +0200

